        ("Anthropologists studying nomadic pastoralists emphasize that seasonal migrations are not aimless wanderings, but highly regulated adaptations to ecological ___.", "fluctuations", "monotonies", "permanences", "stagnations", "研究游牧民族的人類學家反覆強調，游牧民族的季節性逐水草而居遷徙絕非漫無目的的隨意遊蕩，而是對區域生態環境資源「週期性波動起伏」的高度制度化規律適應。", "adaptations to ecological fluctuations（對生態波動的適應）。", "環境波動名詞選 fluctuations。", "pastoralist", "/ˈpæs.tɚ.əl.ɪst/", "游牧民牧民", "fluctuation", "/ˌflʌk.tʃuˈeɪ.ʃən/", "波動起伏變動"),
        ("The sudden abandonment of the ancestral cliff dwellings remains an enigma, though paleoclimatological data points to catastrophic multi-decadal ___.", "droughts", "floods", "monsoons", "hurricanes", "這座古代崖壁懸崖聚落遺址的突發廢棄至今依然是一大歷史未解之謎，儘管古氣候學數據強烈指向曾發生過長達數十年之久的災難性毀滅「大乾旱」。", "cliff dwellings in arid regions abandoned due to prolonged droughts（乾旱導致遺址廢棄）。", "氣候災難名詞選 droughts。", "dwelling", "/ˈdwel.ɪŋ/", "住處住所住宅", "drought", "/draʊt/", "乾旱旱災"),
        ("Ethnoarchaeologists live among contemporary indigenous potters to observe ceramic manufacturing techniques, drawing analogies to interpret ancient ceramic ___.", "assemblages", "languages", "skeletons", "diaries", "民族考古學家深入現代原住民製陶匠人聚落同吃同住，悉心觀察傳統陶器手工製作技藝，藉由建立類比推論來精準破譯古代陶器「組合器物群遺存」。", "ceramic assemblages（陶器器物群組合）為考古學標準專業術語。", "考古組合群術語選 assemblages。", "assemblage", "/əˈsem.blɪdʒ/", "裝配組合器物群集合物", "analogy", "/əˈnæl.ə.dʒi/", "類比比擬類似"),
