        ("The excavation of royal burial mounds revealed an astonishing degree of wealth accumulation, confirming extreme social ___ in early agricultural societies.", "stratification", "egalitarianism", "anarchy", "communism", "對皇家王室大型積石墓塚的田野發掘揭露了令人震驚的財富積累集中程度，確鑿證實了早期農業定居社會便已存在著極端的社會「階層分化分層懸殊」。", "royal burial mounds with wealth accumulation confirm social stratification（王陵財富證實階層分化）。", "社會分層專有名詞選 stratification。", "stratification", "/ˌstræt̬.ə.fəˈkeɪ.ʃən/", "階層化分層分級", "egalitarianism", "/ɪˌɡæl.əˈter.i.ən.ɪ.zəm/", "平等主義均等論"),
